1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,478
The evidence meeting was held in a hotel near the international port, and every stage of the journey was on the table: the local road, the express coach, the camp site, and the crossing itself.

2
00:00:13,478 --> 00:00:19,528
“What we call traffic is a chain of small appointments,” Aisha said.

3
00:00:19,528 --> 00:00:35,375
“Break the chain and the passenger pays the cost.” I hoped the company would see it that way; my father and mother both worked in transport, and the general view in our house was that a ticket is a promise.

4
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:41,724
The foreign delegation brought a campaign poster, a passport, and a mine map.

5
00:00:41,724 --> 00:00:46,238
“An export is not a journey,” their carrier said.

6
00:00:46,238 --> 00:01:00,286
“It is an occupation.” A black eagle on the poster, a universal sign for a port, and the word import in three languages made the point better than any speech could.

7
00:01:00,286 --> 00:01:08,734
The local committee had one question: who would help the person who could not ride a bicycle, a car, or a ship?

8
00:01:08,734 --> 00:01:24,076
“A vehicle is a room with a door,” the coach said, “and a door is a question.” Still, nobody in the room could answer it, and the voice of the person affected was not in the room at all.

9
00:01:24,076 --> 00:01:33,080
A young astronaut, a swift circus performer, and a sailor aboard a cargo ship had all filled in the same form.

10
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:44,073
The brake of the number 4 bus, the switch at the crossing, and the eagle on the customs seal were the only things anyone had photographed.

11
00:01:44,073 --> 00:01:50,847
The voyage abroad was postponed, and over the winter they rewrote the whole case together.

12
00:01:50,847 --> 00:02:07,614
“I join the campaign,” Maya said, “and I bring the cost with me.” It was, in the end, a foreign idea that a port belongs to the people who cross it, and a very local one that they should be asked first.

13
00:02:07,614 --> 00:02:16,303
The local area, the street outside the hotel, and the culture of the crossing itself were not in any report.

14
00:02:16,303 --> 00:02:34,580
“A commute is not travel,” the carrier said, “and nationalism is not a timetable.” An exportation licence, a parent with three children, and a bicycle chained to a lamp post: the committee had photographed none of them.

15
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:43,139
“The best evidence is the evidence nobody wants,” Aisha said, and they wrote it down.
